title: "AANAT7223: Formaldehyde transcriptomics analysis code and provenance materials"
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: "Curated analysis scripts and provenance metadata supporting a cross-dataset re-analysis of public formaldehyde-associated nasal epithelial transcriptomic datasets."
keywords:
  - formaldehyde
  - transcriptomics
  - nasal epithelium
  - toxicogenomics
  - GEO
  - limma
  - gene set enrichment
  - reproducible research
